{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ce9e1fd7978d2a3301883a6fa8d55022999c4687603fb60dd72381c02d6c3b03", "ja": "（公演の最後は、琴葉の歌う『シルエット』で\n締めくくった。力のこもった歌声に、拍手が響く……）", "zh": "（公演的最后，由琴叶演唱的《シルエット》作为收尾。充满力量的歌声中，掌声响起……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "64320017ebcd56f4131ffa6a6f8319aa9ac96113bbb2f74ebd9f31d9981cfe5b", "ja": "{$P$}。私のワガママを\nたくさん聞いてくれて、ありがとうございました。", "zh": "{$P$}。谢谢你听从了我那么多任性的要求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b682ad9e8021180b70fcc5a09bb952196959c1fdfe2f3738f4a34e09bba0e950", "ja": "期待に応えてくれてありがとう。\n琴葉のおかげで、最高の公演になったよ。", "zh": "谢谢你回应了我的期待。\n多亏了琴叶，才有了最棒的演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "8df934deb2355b411f84c96b8b7dd7adab4623f2d6cb6d34e7329ce5863776aa", "ja": "私も、{$P$}がサポートしてくれた\nおかげで、納得のいくステージができました。", "zh": "我也多亏了{$P$}的支持，才能完成令自己满意的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "f32b1de4b26709dafe5371eebfde31f23525a0c0be2909a03fd7422b9b73cfe0", "ja": "レッスンをしながら、ずっと考えてたんです。\nこの曲を歌う上で、私はどうしたいんだろう……って。", "zh": "一边练习，我一直在思考。\n唱这首歌的时候，我究竟想要怎么做……蕴含这样的疑问。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "c14b6d2b0bdb497adefd454da72bf3c59dd2462b210fb943b88fe74cb3fbb821", "ja": "ちゃんと自分と向き合わないと、\nこの曲の想いが伝えられないんじゃないかって。", "zh": "要是不好好面对自己，\n恐怕就无法传达出这首歌的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2590817e60b7d1eb8c635f77f14a21f6ef221bd40f137323cf70d55ca2033f21", "ja": "そうか。納得のいくステージができたってことは\n答えは出たみたいだな。", "zh": "这样啊。既然能完成让自己满意的舞台，\n看来你已经找到答案了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "7f66d87327fc2c86e6949e545d860092c3a2e9f9a665eb6fee7ea5830fa9781f", "ja": "はい。それは、きっと……\nある人に向けて歌おうって、決めたからだと思います。", "zh": "是的。那一定是因为……\n我决定要为某个人歌唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1008_p", "source_sha256": "31070f3c0c4de0a8fcd26f212a86e4bb701a063f1e28f7bd58f4ee70dd0c451c", "ja": "ある人？", "zh": "某个人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "b41619772f39d3027c4190a3c605d4a0c7d0030586f8ce67dc7dd1cc24171355", "ja": "……{$P$}に。\nも、もちろん！　ちゃんとした理由はあるんですよ？", "zh": "……送给{$P$}。\n当、当然了！我可是有充分理由的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "c9780563bc6ab3041d1ac59a48eb0c939fb84f34d533de5b750d92efbb44ca17", "ja": "私がアイドルになってから、\nずっと、私と向き合ってくれて……。", "zh": "自从我成为偶像以来，\n您一直……一直都在认真地面对我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "81ef722f244bc090aded007fd4fcc065ea9360a71969a52b5c83361c80350c9c", "ja": "客観的に、私のことを一番知っているのは、\n{$P$}だと思うんです。", "zh": "从客观的角度来说，我认为最了解我的，\n就是{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0a6379836d51be854e8816b43d6d5426297e12e1b39a017178279aa29737cd65", "ja": "琴葉……。", "zh": "琴叶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "3096164db64ba99c7857a21f7250595c719ffb3ecc8b1eb78bb81b891b6ed7c0", "ja": "臆病で前に踏み出せない私を、いつも、\nそばで支えてくれて、見守ってくれる人だから……。", "zh": "因为那个人总是在身边支持我，守望着那个胆小得不敢迈出脚步的我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "aee574af8e37ccefa1f20e6e8f902d7b28c1839b558aecde92372841f1c24d7c", "ja": "だから、{$P$}のことを想像したら。\n私の気持ちを届けられるんじゃないかって……。", "zh": "所以，我想象着{$P$}的话。\n或许就能将我的心意传达给你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "4c2041985c20cad605cfd6d65ceedc0b20f8bd3cbded5a9e7704125f7d40c089", "ja": "な、なんて！　すみません。曲の話をしてたのに。\nちょっと、重い……ですよね？", "zh": "我、我这是在说什么！对不起，明明是在聊歌曲的。  \n有点沉重……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c57f004b1e4813175d86f4ff438bcd4dce2701fe55362ad6c162dbc4dbef4562", "ja": "いや、いいと思う。心からアイドルに向き合ってる\nからこそ、湧き出てきた気持ちだと思うから。", "zh": "不会，我觉得很好。正因为你是发自内心对待\n偶像这件事，才会涌现出这样的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1017_p", "source_sha256": "52a85467c4ff834daa4d5c6cae9cb22531d490b1cb9c1218013b603b0495b8fd", "ja": "ちゃんと琴葉の力になれてたなら、嬉しいよ。", "zh": "如果真的能帮到琴叶，我就很高兴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "edeb8552fdf58d2e9477e017d508266bfe5d643e02d0c82d52d196012d86818b", "ja": "いつか自分自身を誇れるようになれたら……アイドルと\nしても、もっと成長できるのかなって思ってます。", "zh": "等哪天我也能为自己感到骄傲了……我想，\n作为一名偶像，肯定也能够获得更大的成长吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0614_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "cd4f434c32f9a40baf4205714fda1414afa02a6283e670f0ad92711c8dc446c5", "ja": "だからこれからも、力を貸してください。\n私のこと、見守っていてくださいね♪", "zh": "所以今后也请助我一臂之力。\n请继续守望着我哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
